    <section class="references" id="sect-00010">
    <title>References</title>
    <para id="para-00032">Bipartisan Policy Center. (2022, March 1). <emphasis effect="italics">Paid family leave across OECD countries.</emphasis> https://bipartisanpolicy.org/explainer/paid-family-leave-across-oecd-countries/</para>
